# Report per-edit diff and line-count summaries

Consider concise change summaries after edit tool calls so users can see the scale of each change.

Suggestions:
- Check what edit_file and write_file already return before adding another diff computation.
- Clarify whether the summary is per call or cumulative, especially when the working tree already contains unrelated edits.
- Explore existing tool presentation or post_tool_use hooks rather than making the core understand source edits.
- Include no-op and failed edits in the design discussion.

Related: tui/word-diff.

